            <ArticleTitle>Lumbar sympathectomy in the treatment of peripheral vascular occlusive disease. Ten year study.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>309-14</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A study of the results of lumbar sympathectomy in the treatment of peripheral vascular occlusive disease has been presented. Results continue to be encouraging in properly selected patients, as they have been since 1947.</AbstractText>
